    #id: lm_ankle_r

    The right ankle joint. Select the points in the viewport with the arrow button. The average of the points is the landmark. Leave it empty to let Rig Fit guess this landmark.

    Type: Group picker (text; the menu lists the point groups of the input, the arrow button picks in the viewport). Default: (empty).

